<back><div type="verses">
<lg><l>Lives again!</l><l>Our Jesus lives again.</l><l>(Oh, yes, He)</l><l>Lives again!</l><l>He ascended into heav’n.</l><l>(Amen, He)</l><l>Lives again!</l><l>Our Jesus lives again,</l><l>So we must go and tell all men.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
